# Citation metadata of h4lat (https://citation-file-format.github.io).
# GitHub reads this file for the "Cite this repository" button, and Zenodo for the record of each release.
# Update `version` and `date-released` at every release.
# `doi` is the Zenodo concept DOI, which covers all versions and resolves to the latest one; each release also
# gets its own DOI on Zenodo (e.g. 10.5281/zenodo.23598682 for v0.2.0).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use h4lat in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "h4lat: Clebsch-Gordan coefficients and lattice operators for the hypercubic group H(4)"
abstract: >-
  h4lat computes Clebsch-Gordan coefficients of the hypercubic group H(4) and builds H(4)-irreducible lattice
  operators ψ̄ Γ D⋯D ψ (Γ = 𝟙, γ₅, γ_μ, γ_μγ₅, σ_μν) for moments of parton distribution functions, together with
  their kinematic factors, C-parity, trace condition and index symmetry. It ships a database of 1360 operators
  with up to three derivatives.
authors:
